{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"LEV","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"利未記","commonName":"利未記","title":"利未記","order":3,"numberOfChapters":27,"sha256":"7ef7fe3d48f7fd220ad5bf6e3ffe06ef19daec3d96e187352fb24c51eb9822ea","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/LEV/1.json","lastChapterNumber":27,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/LEV/27.json","totalNumberOfVerses":858},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["燔祭的條例"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華從會幕中呼叫摩西，對他說："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「你曉諭以色列人說：你們中間若有人獻供物給耶和華，要從牛群羊群中獻牲畜為供物。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["「他的供物若以牛為燔祭，就要在會幕門口獻一隻沒有殘疾的公牛，可以在耶和華面前蒙悅納。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["他要按手在燔祭牲的頭上，燔祭便蒙悅納，為他贖罪。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["他要在耶和華面前宰公牛；亞倫子孫作祭司的，要奉上血，把血灑在會幕門口、壇的周圍。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["那人要剝去燔祭牲的皮，把燔祭牲切成塊子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["祭司亞倫的子孫要把火放在壇上，把柴擺在火上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["亞倫子孫作祭司的，要把肉塊和頭並脂油擺在壇上火的柴上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["但燔祭的臟腑與腿要用水洗。祭司就要把一切全燒在壇上，當作燔祭，獻與耶和華為馨香的火祭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["「人的供物若以綿羊或山羊為燔祭，就要獻上沒有殘疾的公羊。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["要把羊宰於壇的北邊，在耶和華面前；亞倫子孫作祭司的，要把羊血灑在壇的周圍。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["要把燔祭牲切成塊子，連頭和脂油，祭司就要擺在壇上火的柴上；"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["但臟腑與腿要用水洗，祭司就要全然奉獻，燒在壇上。這是燔祭，是獻與耶和華為馨香的火祭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["「人奉給耶和華的供物，若以鳥為燔祭，就要獻斑鳩或是雛鴿為供物。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["祭司要把鳥拿到壇前，揪下頭來，把鳥燒在壇上；鳥的血要流在壇的旁邊；"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["又要把鳥的嗉子和髒物",{"noteId":0},"除掉，丟在壇的東邊倒灰的地方。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["要拿着鳥的兩個翅膀，把鳥撕開，只是不可撕斷；祭司要在壇上、在火的柴上焚燒。這是燔祭，是獻與耶和華為馨香的火祭。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"-","text":"髒物：或譯翎毛","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":16}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/LEV/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/LEV/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EXO/40.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}